## 🔄 OpenSpec Methodology & Workflow

The project uses a strict Spec-Driven Development workflow based on [OpenSpec](https://github.com/Fission-AI/OpenSpec):

```
propose ──► ⛔ GATE ──► analyze ──► apply ──► verify ──► sync ──► archive
              │            │                   │                    │
       Quality check +   Simulate loop       Completeness:        Merge delta
       scope guardrail   WITHOUT writing:    100% requirements    into living
                         Is it executable?   verified + checked   spec
```

### Safety Guardrails
1. **Gate Checklist**: Prevents scope creep and missing Given-When-Then scenarios before touching code.
2. **`analyze`**: Read-only dry run checking if tasks are executable in order.
3. **`verify`**: Ensures 100% of delta requirements have passing tests and checked tasks.
4. **`archive`**: Ensures living specs (`spec.md` and `circuit.md`) are updated before closing the change.

